watchdog.resource/ArmWatchdog                    watchdog.resource/ArmWatchdog

   NAME
	ArmWatchdog -- Arm the watchdog: after `millis` ms without a FeedWatchdog it does `action` (WATCHDOG_RESET_SYSTEM or WATCHDOG_RESET_CPU).

   SYNOPSIS
	    bool ArmWatchdog(u32 millis, u32 action)

   BEHAVIOR
	Armed again, it starts over. False for 0 ms, too long a time, an action
	the watchdog has not got, or a machine with no watchdog the resource
	drives. A chipset's watchdog counts whole seconds, `millis` rounded up,
	and only resets the whole machine.
watchdog.resource/DisarmWatchdog              watchdog.resource/DisarmWatchdog

   NAME
